# L §5.5: an axis may be the mode of round "when every option is a rounding code (§2.2); otherwise LOAD-UNIT".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2016-03-01
  start 2015-11-01
  end 2016-10-31

axis ul05_cut
  floor "the cut rounds down to whole złoty"
  exact "no rounding is stated"

input x: num
input one: num

ask q1: round(x, one, ul05_cut)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
